@chapter Crate @code{gpui-ui-kit}
@cindex gpui-ui-kit
@cindex UI components

@code{gpui-ui-kit} is the reusable UI component library used by the
SotF desktop player. It provides 40+ composable, themed components
covering the full surface of a desktop application: layout, forms,
data display and audio-specific controls.

